1191
01:03:42,752 --> 01:03:45,522
Steady as she goes
for torpedo attack.

1192
01:03:45,522 --> 01:03:49,826
- Course 2-7-5. Range 1500.
- Course 2-7-5, sir.

1193
01:03:49,826 --> 01:03:51,528
Firing gap.

1194
01:03:51,528 --> 01:03:53,830
Ready to open fire, sir.

1195
01:03:53,830 --> 01:03:57,400
- Fire one!
- Movie much longer than it
would have been without us, sir.

1196
