say! Here comes another!
The circus is destroyed.

1255
01:07:14,731 --> 01:07:18,101
- Oof.
- Maybe we should go
to the zoo, instead.

1256
01:07:18,101 --> 01:07:20,303
That's a good idea.
We'll be right back.

1257
01:07:20,303 --> 01:07:22,538
- Clown-killer!
- Maybe.

1258
01:07:30,580 --> 01:07:33,216
- Eeh.
- You got clown blood?

1259
01:07:33,216 --> 01:07:37,487
- I'm safe.
- You know, I don't think
